  "item_short_desc": "<p>Gear up with Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Digital Camo BDU Pants, mirroring the design of our adult BDU pants. Crafted from a durable 55% Cotton / 45% Polyester blend, these pants are the perfect companion for young adventurers. The comfortable fabric ensures a pleasant experience during outdoor escapades, while the variety of camo colors adds a touch of style. Featuring 2 front slash pockets, 2 button-down bellow leg pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets, these pants offer ample storage for little treasures and essentials.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "20752",
  "description": "<p>Gear up with Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Digital Camo BDU Pants, mirroring the design of our adult BDU pants. Crafted from a durable 55% Cotton / 45% Polyester blend, these pants are the perfect companion for young adventurers. The comfortable fabric ensures a pleasant experience during outdoor escapades, while the variety of camo colors adds a touch of style. Featuring 2 front slash pockets, 2 button-down bellow leg pockets, and 2 button-down back pockets, these pants offer ample storage for little treasures and essentials. The adjustable waist tabs and zipper fly guarantee a secure and customizable fit, adapting to your child&rsquo;s growing needs. Additionally, drawstring ankle ties add versatility, allowing for different styles and preferences. Let your kids explore the world in comfort and style with Rothco&rsquo;s Kids Digital Camo BDU Pants, designed for the next generation of outdoor enthusiasts. Rothco stands out as the leader in camouflage clothing and accessories. With a rich heritage spanning over 7 decades, we have honed our expertise in crafting durable and effective camouflage gear. Our extensive range of products, including apparel, bags, and gear, showcases a diverse selection of camouflage, with over 35 patterns available! From outdoor enthusiasts and active-duty personnel, to skate and fashion, Rothco is the go-to brand for camo.</p>",
